[23511,16.9,1954,45,111,21],[23512,17.4,1954,46,103,24]],"links":[["Kit Carson County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/colorado/kit-carson-county"],["ARC or PLC in Kit Carson County","/arc-plc/colorado/kit-carson-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids in Kit Carson County came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years for February to March, March to April and November to December. In 2025 the middle ran 62% of normal in April to May and 202% in August to September. So far in 2026 it sits at 23% of normal for March to April and 35% for February to March. Grid 22911 had its driest year in 1954 at 48%.</p>"}
